abstract: >-
  Graphviz sources and Python scripts that regenerate every figure in the article
  "Artificial intelligence–enabled digital twins for forecasting cancer burden from oral
  nicotine pouches: a review and expert opinion", together with the framework pseudocode,
  sample data schema, and validation and reproducibility checklists from its Supplementary
  Methods. All plotted values are synthetic placeholders; no model was fitted to real data.
